    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our platform also includes features such as role-based access control (RBAC), audit logging, and configurable retention policies aligned with legal archival obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure reliability and traceability of outputs, we product Atelier provides explainability features, including grounded and traceable figures or factual statements. we also maintain a complete audit trail, which can be used to demonstrate compliance with regulatory requirements. we secure software development life cycle (SDLC) includes code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external provider of equivalent CREST level. we also have incident response procedures in place, including detection, notification, and remediation, as well as a 72-hour GDPR breach-notification workflow. we are familiar with anti-money-laundering obligations (LCB-FT) and ensure that Our platform does not undermine a firm's reporting obligations. we also respect auditor independence and separation of duties, ensuring that Our platform is used as a non-decisional support tool." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Finally, we guarantee data sovereignty by hosting all data within the EU and ensuring that no data is transferred outside the EU. we infrastructure is designed to ensure the protection of sensitive data, using encryption and pseudonymisation where relevant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing these security measures, we can guarantee compliance with the mentioned regulatory requirements and provide a secure and reliable platform for we clients." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance, professional secrecy, confidentiality of client data, auditor independence, separation of duties, anti-money-laundering obligations (LCB-FT), legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents, and non-decisional assistance tool." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these regulatory requirements?" ;
