    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we can identify the following potential legal risks:  non-compliance with GDPR, breach of professional secrecy, confidentiality of client data, auditor independence, separation of duties, anti-money-laundering obligations (LCB-FT), and non-adherence to legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding compliance, we is a Société par actions simplifiée (SAS) registered in France, and we have experience working with clients bound by professional secrecy.  we are familiar with the contractual expectations of such clients and maintain administrative attestations available, including those related to up-to-date social and fiscal obligations. we intellectual property model includes the Atelier platform as proprietary software owned by Faber IA, licensed to the client under a subscription or usage model for the contract term, ensuring control over data handling.  we also use open-source components with permissive licenses and provide an SBOM to the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we have professional liability insurance of 10 million euros per claim and general civil liability cover." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

